    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHC23ED7D881DE2A04A62E045FF5D4ADA2" xlink:label="HHC23ED7D881DE2A04A62E045FF5D4ADA2" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH3685CA770A70C4F59C1BC6CC0F7A19AE" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p class="MsoNormal">Page 110 line 48 Plant Materials and Operating Supplies (154): For purposes of the Settled Formula Rate</p>
        <p>&#160;</p>
        <p class="MsoNormal">Under Attachment F of the ISO-NE OATT, the company&#8217;s Account No. 154 balances for 2025 Q1, 2025 Q2 and 2025 Q3 includes Transmission Materials and Supplies of $ 13,325,748, $12,688,019 and $12,451,475 respectively.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHC23ED7D881DE2A04A62E045FF5D4ADA2" xlink:to="HH3685CA770A70C4F59C1BC6CC0F7A19AE" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH2BC78F3014294A71C1AD42880C1B14AE" xlink:label="HH2BC78F3014294A71C1AD42880C1B14AE" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHA7D41DA981FE3CE61C262D90F9D82544" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Vermont Transco. LLC is 100% Transmission, therefore for purposes of the formula rate in Attachment F of the ISO New England OATT, Transmission-related General Advertising Expense equals 100% of the balance in FERC account 930.1.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
